<title>USA: Patient Infosystems names L. Serafino COO.</title>
<headline>Patient Infosystems names L. Serafino COO.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patient Infosystems Inc said Monday it named Len Serafino senior vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>A spokesman said the COO job is a newly-created position.</p>
<p>Serafino was formerly vice president of sales and managed Care at American Home Patient Inc.</p>
